    <string name="audio_consent_title">Music through the car speakers</string>
    <string name="audio_consent_message">Android only lets apps send other apps\' sound to the car through its screen capture permission. On the next screen Android asks to start capturing: BetterAuto only takes the music audio, nothing on the screen is recorded or shared.\n\nTip: to skip this every time, run once from a computer:\nadb shell appops set com.simoneluconi.betterauto PROJECT_MEDIA allow</string>
