    <string name="wireless_card">Connect to the car without a cable, through a wireless dongle or a wireless head unit</string>
    <string name="wireless_hint">Pair the dongle or the head unit with this phone in its Bluetooth settings first. BetterAuto then talks to it over Bluetooth, joins its WiFi (Android asks you once) and starts the session. The cable keeps working as before and wins when plugged in. Turn the official Android Auto off, or it competes for the same connection.</string>
